      chapterEyebrow:'White Coast Longevity · First Chapter',chapterTitle:'Live longer.<br><em>Belong</em> somewhere.',chapterText:'White Coast is KŌMØ’s first local expression: a Costa Blanca community connecting movement, recovery, selected experiences and people who share a longevity ambition.',chapterCta:'Discover the Jávea project',chapterNotes:[['Territory','Jávea · Dénia · Moraira · Altea'],['Format','Community · Retreats · local network']],chapterQuote:'A longer life deserves to be <em>better inhabited.</em>',
      scienceEyebrow:'Science & method',scienceTitle:'Measure with method.<br>Explain <em>without overpromising.</em>',scienceLead:'KŌMØ brings together functional questionnaires, physical tests, supervised measures and longitudinal follow-up. Every component is distinguished by its level of evidence and use.',scienceCta:'Discover the scientific method',finalTitle:'Measure today.<br>Live longer <em>in motion.</em>',finalText:'Your mobility starts with a first measurement. Your trajectory continues in KŌMØ.',finalCta:'Explore your mobility'
